k at a campaign rally in Akron, Ohio, alongside former New York mayor Rudy Giuliani on Aug. 22, 2016. Gerald Herbert, APFullscreen Mexico President Enrique Pena Nieto and Trump shake hands after a joint statement at Los Pinos, the presidential official residence, in Mexico City on Aug. 31, 2016. Marco Ugarte, APFullscreen Trump arrives for his immigration speech at the Phoenix Convention Center on Aug. 31, 2016. Michael Chow/The Republic, Michael Chow-USA TODAY SportsFullscreen Trump speaks with 'Today' show co-anchor Matt Lauer at the NBC Commander-In-Chief Forum held at the Intrepid Sea, Air and Space museum in New York on Sept. 7, 2016. Evan Vucci, APFullscreen Trump waves as he steps out of his plane for a rally at the JetCenters of Colorado in Colorado Springs on Sept. 17, 2016. Mandel Ngan, AFP/Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump speaks during a rally at Duplin County Events Center in Kenansville, N.C., on Sept. 20, 2016. Mandel Ngan, AFP/Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump and Clinton shake hands at the end of the first presidential debate at Hofstra University in Hempstead, N.Y., on Sept. 26, 2016. Joe Raedle, AFP/Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump meets with members of the National Border Patrol Council at Trump Tower on Oct. 7, 2016, in New York. Evan Vucci, APFullscreen Trump and Clinton take part in the town hall debate at Washington University on Oct. 9, 2016, in St Louis. Saul Loeb, Pool/Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump walks off the stage followed by his wife, Melania, after the final presidential debate in Las Vegas on Oct. 19, 2016. Robyn Beck, AFP/Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump sits down with Wisconsin Gov. Scott Walker and a group of small-business owners for a roundtable meeting on Nov. 1, 2016, in Altoona, Wis. Chip Somodevilla, Getty ImagesFullscreen Donald Trump waves to supporters who were waiting outside of the fence following a rally at the Sun Country Airlines hangar in Minneapolis on Nov. 6, 2016. Mandel Ngan, AFP/Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump looks at his wife, Melania, as they cast their votes at PS-59 on Nov. 8, 2016, in New York. Evan Vucci, APFullscreen Trump, accompanied by wife Melania, Vice President-elect Mike Pence and House Speaker Paul Ryan, speaks after a meeting with Ryan, on Nov. 10, 2016, in the Speaker's office on Capitol Hill in Washington. Alex Brandon, APFullscreen President Obama and Trump shake hands following their meeting in the Oval Office on Nov. 10, 2016. Pablo Martinez Monsivais, APFullscreen Trump pauses in the entryway of Trump National Golf Club Bedminster clubhouse on Nov. 20, 2016, in Bedminster, N.J. Carolyn Kaster, APFullscreen Trump walks through the lobby of The New York Times following a meeting with editors at the paper on Nov. 22, 2016, in New York City. Spencer Platt, Getty ImagesFullscreen Trump dines with Mitt Romney at Jean Georges Restaurant in New York City on Nov. 29, 2016. John Angelillo, Pool/European Pressphoto AgencyFullscreen Trump speaks at U.S. Bank Arena on Dec. 1, 2016, in Cincinnati. He took time off from selecting his Cabinet to celebrate his election victory. Ty Wright, Getty ImagesFullscreenLike this topic? You may also like these photo galleries:Replay1 of 902 of 903 of 904 of 905 of 906 of 907 of 908 of 909 of 9010 of 9011 of 9012 of 9013 of 9014 of 9015 of 9016 of 9017 of 9018 of 9019 of 9020 of 9021 of 9022 of 9023 of 9024 of 9025 of 9026 of 9027 of 9028 of 9029 of 9030 of 9031 of 9032 of 9033 of 9034 of 9035 of 9036 of 9037 of 9038 of 9039 of 9040 of 9041 of 9042 of 9043 of 9044 of 9045 of 9046 of 9047 of 9048 of 9049 of 9050 of 9051 of 9052 of 9053 of 9054 of 9055 of 9056 of 9057 of 9058 of 9059 of 9060 of 9061 of 9062 of 9063 of 9064 of 9065 of 9066 of 9067 of 9068 of 9069 of 9070 of 9071 of 9072 of 9073 of 9074 of 9075 of 9076 of 9077 of 9078 of 9079 of 9080 of 9081 of 9082 of 9083 of 9084 of 9085 of 9086 of 9087 of 9088 of 9089 of 9090 of 90AutoplayShow ThumbnailsShow CaptionsLast SlideNext Slide 2 CONNECTTWEETLINKEDINCOMMENTEMAILMORERead or Share this story