d computer server in the United Kingdom that FBI agents at first believed served as a communications hub for the hackers.  British police secretly copied the contents of the server.  7 CONNECT 23 TWEET 1 LINKEDIN 1 COMMENTEMAILMORERead or Share this story: http://usat.ly/1h6ffTA",2014-06-04,eng,usatoday.com,-0.4196078431372549,False,news,http://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2014/06/03/fbi-busts-russian-hacked-created-zeus-cryptolocker/9919985/,3.08
